Ilus kala.

144
00:08:53.300 --> 00:08:56.025
Esimene ilus kalapaadis kohe.

145
00:09:00.880 --> 00:09:03.480
Ahai ja läks pidu lahti.

146
00:09:30.450 --> 00:09:32.390
Ilm on ilus.

147
00:09:32.490 --> 00:09:34.910
Tuulehaug on kohal.

148
00:09:35.010 --> 00:09:38.030
Tuulehaugi kehtib ka kohal.
Esimesed kalad on paadis,

149
00:09:38.130 --> 00:09:41.000
